# ─── Closdex Web — environment variables ────────────────────────────────────
#
# Copy to .env.local and fill in. Never commit .env.local.
#
# In dev: leave unset — next.config.js proxies /api/* → localhost:4000 for you.
# On VPS (Traefik/nginx serves both /api and /): leave unset — same-origin routing works.
# On Vercel (separate API host): set this to your Railway/Render API URL.

# NEXT_PUBLIC_API_URL=https://closdex-api.up.railway.app/api
